description: Never commit secrets, tokens, or sandbox credentials in the agtsmith fork
alwaysApply: true
---

# agtsmith Secrets

- Never commit `config/ui.env`, `.env`, or files containing `SPLUNK_LAB_BEARER_TOKEN`
- Never hardcode sandbox `dev` passwords in source, docs, or Splunk app `default/`
- Store MCP tokens in gitignored `config/ui.env` or Splunk `passwords.conf` only
- Use `config/ui.env.example` for public placeholders
